  m_Name: Ranged_MultiHitVolley_Tracking
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Phasix.Runtime::SkillData
  _skillName: Tracking Volley
  _description: Attack Pattern Directive Group 2 - Multi-Hit Volley exploration option
    #3 ("Steady Slow"). Same 8-hit compass sequence as the original "Volley" (Basic
    Count), but every ring is a flat, generous 1.2s instead of 0.45s, with a slower
    dash cadence (0.2s/leg vs the 0.10s default) - so several rings stay open simultaneously
    through most of the cast. Shifts the challenge from raw reaction speed to tracking
    several open rings at once and hitting them in the right order.
